requirements refunds v1
description "What the refund desk answers: an example for ritsu impact"

role finance "Decides who refunds what"
role development "Writes the desk"

requirement bands_of_a_refund
  text "A refund of up to 20 items is small, and a larger one is large"
  owner finance
